WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,540 --> 00:00:09,220
We're almost there. Don't be careless.

2
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,540
Senior, I can't do it anymore

3
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,420
I feel like I have to run a thousand meters again

4
00:00:22,540 --> 00:00:23,980
I must be number one in the women's group

5
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,500
I'll lean on you for a while. I can't do it anymore.

6
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:31,810
The weather is 30 degrees and sunny

7
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:33,490
Today’s daytime lasts for

8
00:00:33,490 --> 00:00:36,170
Ten hours, one day left before famine arrives

9
00:00:36,170 --> 00:00:38,090
There are five days left in the novice protection period

10
00:00:38,290 --> 00:00:39,450
There is only one day tomorrow

11
00:00:39,690 --> 00:00:41,410
Including today, I barely scraped together two days

12
00:00:43,190 --> 00:00:45,310
Senior, why am I sleeping on the bed?

13
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,550
You picked me up
